stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RUNNING : Transfer started

  RUNNING --> CRASHED : Process crash / silent failure

  CRASHED --> RECOVERING_SELF_HEAL : Self-healing mode (gateway restarts)
  CRASHED --> BACKUP_TAKES_OVER : Primary-backup mode (heartbeat timeout exceeded)

  RECOVERING_SELF_HEAL --> STATE_SYNC : Send RECOVER to counterparty
  BACKUP_TAKES_OVER --> SESSION_RESUMPTION : Backup validates X.509 chain
  SESSION_RESUMPTION --> STATE_SYNC : Backup sends RECOVER

  STATE_SYNC --> LOG_UPDATED : Receive RECOVER-UPDATE (log diff applied)
  LOG_UPDATED --> RECOVERY_CONFIRMED : Send RECOVER-UPDATE-ACK / Receive RECOVER-SUCCESS

  RECOVERY_CONFIRMED --> RUNNING : Resume SATP execution

  RUNNING --> ROLLBACK_INITIATED : Counterparty crash detected (timeout expired)
  ROLLBACK_INITIATED --> ROLLING_BACK : Execute rollback actions
  ROLLING_BACK --> ROLLBACK_COMPLETE : Send ROLLBACK / Receive ROLLBACK-ACK
  ROLLBACK_COMPLETE --> [*] : Transfer aborted
